{'_content': 'The Tara Angkor Hotel is proud to present its newest restaurant “Frangipani’. Named after a flower which can be seen throughout the hotel’s garden, the restaurant is an excellent retreat in between and after tours. If you or your guests are looking for a calm and more defined meal to satisfy your appetite, the Frangipani restaurant offers a selective choice of European as well as Asian delicacies.

Open from 10 am to 10 pm
'}

