{'_content': '<i>A thirteen-photo vacation album.</i>

We've been eating at <a href="http://www.harringtonsbythebay.com/" rel="nofollow">Harrington's</a> (and its predecessor, Freshwater Lodge) for many years. The prices have increased over time, and the food's gotten fancier. 

We keep going back, so they're doing something right.'}

