{'_content': 'LEVEL Furnished Living is downtown Vancouver's premier serviced apartment building redefining the traditional concept of extended stay accommodations with comfortable furnishings, state-of-the-art facilities, and a focus on customized service. 

See the steps which went into making LEVEL a place of home comforts with hotel service.

<a href="http://www.stayinglevel.com" rel="nofollow">www.stayinglevel.com</a>'}

{'_content': 'Harvest by Polygon, is a collection of Modern-Farmhouse inspired townhomes at Polygon’s new landmark master-planned community of Westerleigh in West Abbotsford.

This collection of two and three bedroom townhome residences showcases striking ‘Modern-Farmhouse’ architecture with welcoming verandahs and charming window boxes. Contemporary interiors feature open plan layouts and gourmet kitchens with granite counters, stainless steel appliances and warm laminate flooring. For added convenience, private decks invite outdoor living and attached garages welcome residents of every home.

Located in the growing West Abbotsford neighbourhood, Harvest is minutes away from education, recreation and urban amenities. And, every Harvest resident can take advantage of membership to Club West, Westerleigh’s resort-style private clubhouse with outdoor pool, fitness studio, fireside lounge, hockey room, theatre room and much more.'}

{'_content': 'Perched on a ridge with great views to the Fraser River and beyond to the Straight of Georgia, discover Capella, Polygon’s latest collection of executive townhome residences at the landmark master-planned community of Sunstone in North Delta.

This exclusive enclave of four bedroom townhomes showcases welcoming Arts and Crafts architecture with dramatic pitched roofs, charming gables, Juliet balconies and window boxes. Inside, spacious contemporary interiors feature over 2,000 square feet of living space with open-plan layouts, gourmet kitchens with granite countertops, warm laminate flooring, and sleek stainless steel appliances. For added convenience, large private decks or rear gardens invite outdoor entertaining.

<a href="http://www.polyhomes.com/community/capella-townhomes-north-delta" rel="nofollow">www.polyhomes.com/community/capella-townhomes-north-delta</a>'}

